#. copy/eyebrow
#: src/js/festival.js:56
msgctxt "tree:copy#/eyebrow"
msgid "FESTIVAL OPERATIONS / SPRING SPELL-CARD LANTERNS × BOUNDARY MATRICULATION"
msgstr "FESTIVAL OPERATIONS / 春季スペルカード灯会 × 境界開学祭"

#. copy/title
#: src/js/festival.js:56
msgctxt "tree:copy#/title"
msgid "A festival is not one success score. It is a campus running all at once."
msgstr "祭典は、一つの成功点で測るものではない。一晩じゅう、すべてが同時に動くキャンパスだ。"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/festival.js:56
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Plan procession, airspace, stalls, power, main gate, and aid stations; six "
"desks stamp independently. Once open, Aya's extra, fairy clouds, Moriya "
"voltage, and poltergeist after-hours sound do not promise to obey the "
"programme."
msgstr "行列、空域、屋台、給電、正門、救護所を組み、六つの机がそれぞれ押印する。開祭後、文の号外も、妖精の雲も、守矢の電気も、騒霊の深夜演奏も、予定表どおりに動くとは限らない。"

